      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "_opt6",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Once I defeat Asheviere and reclaim my throne, I would be more than happy to send aid to Knalga. I understand you have little to give, but right now it is in both of our best interests to work together!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Aye, an’ I thought I’d live out a peaceful life in th’ west halls, but here we both are. We can’t spare any more, Konrad, not even for a prince."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "asked_for_more",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "_opt7",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Friend dwarf, you need all the fighters you can get. What right do I have to demand bread from a starving man? Keep your warriors for Knalga, and may Knalga one day prosper again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You’re a good lad, Konrad. Thank ye, an’ I’m sorry we were so suspicious when ye first showed up."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Whether you get yer throne back or not, you’ll always be welcome in Knalga — what remains o’ it, at least. Between the trolls in the west an’ the orcs in the Doors we’re just spread too thin. Mebbe if those were gone..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "bm_s29_refused_payment",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "finish_mission",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
